WEBVTT

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:03.710
Prepare a paper trade before acting.

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:09.230
Open Trade, and check the instrument you are
viewing.

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:16.770
Choose Buy or Sell deliberately. We will use
Buy.

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:21.590
Check the order type. This example uses
Market.

00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:28.110
Set the lot size. This is an illustrative
practice account.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:33.750
Enable Stop Loss, then enter your exercise's
stop level.

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:40.470
Enable Take Profit, then enter your
exercise's target.

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:45.210
Pause to review the estimated loss and
margin.

00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:51.570
Reduce the lot size, and check how the
estimate changes.

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:58.910
Recheck direction, size, stop and target.
These are estimates.

00:01:01.072 --> 00:01:04.792
Stop here with the prepared ticket. No order
was submitted.
